Your history, Carol.

292
00:16:10,320 --> 00:16:11,940
What else? Hi, kids.

293
00:16:12,120 --> 00:16:14,260
Hi. Mom, Dad!

294
00:16:14,460 --> 00:16:17,680
Oh, no! This is getting good.

295
00:16:18,600 --> 00:16:20,120
I thought you two were shopping.

296
00:16:20,440 --> 00:16:21,740
That's what you were supposed to think.

297
00:16:21,820 --> 00:16:22,840
We parked around the corner.

298
00:16:23,640 --> 00:16:26,960
What do you think, we just hang around the kitchen all day playing Calypso songs on

299
00:16:26,960 --> 00:16:30,540
