304
00:16:45,900 --> 00:16:47,040
We should just tell him the truth.

305
00:16:47,860 --> 00:16:50,160
Huh? Yeah, give that a shot.

306
00:16:50,760 --> 00:16:55,740
Well, uh, the truth is that, um, little Ben here was raffling off his old bike to

307
